1
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:05,700
Two best friends. One business.

2
00:00:05,790 --> 00:00:07,940
15 years of hard work.

3
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,950
Daniel: Bro, 15 years already.

4
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:12,880
Daniel: We really built this from nothing.

5
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,190
Aaron: Next 15 years, we go bigger.

6
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:18,140
Then one night, everything changed.

7
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:22,190
Hospital: Hello, Aaron? I'm calling from the hospital.

8
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:24,580
Hospital: I'm very sorry. It's about Daniel.

9
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:31,700
Sarah: Aaron, I know Daniel loved this business.

10
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:33,490
Sarah: But I don't know how to run it.

11
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:36,030
Sarah: The family needs financial security.

12
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:38,350
Estate representative: Daniel's shares are part of his estate.

13
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:39,890
Estate representative: So any transfer follows the legal

14
00:00:39,910 --> 00:00:42,520
Estate representative: documents and the estate process.

15
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:45,060
Aaron: I understand. I want to buy his shares.

16
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:47,670
Aaron: But the company doesn't have that kind of cash.

17
00:00:47,750 --> 00:00:49,450
The business had value.

18
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,590
But that didn't mean Aaron had a million

19
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:54,680
dollars ready to buy Daniel's shares.

20
00:00:56,650 --> 00:00:59,450
Accountant: To raise that amount, you may have to borrow heavily,

21
00:00:59,470 --> 00:01:02,440
Accountant: sell assets, or bring in another investor.

22
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:05,980
One family needed liquidity.

23
00:01:06,190 --> 00:01:08,800
One founder needed business continuity.

24
00:01:09,050 --> 00:01:10,790
Neither wanted a dispute.

25
00:01:10,810 --> 00:01:13,380
But there was no funded exit plan.

26
00:01:19,950 --> 00:01:22,530
Daniel: Let's do this properly, while we can.

27
00:01:22,550 --> 00:01:25,100
The agreement establishes the path.

28
00:01:25,130 --> 00:01:27,850
Insurance can help provide the money.

29
00:01:27,870 --> 00:01:29,690
Together, they can turn a difficult

30
00:01:29,710 --> 00:01:33,180
ownership transition into a planned one.

31
00:01:40,850 --> 00:01:42,130
Sarah: Thank you, Aaron.

32
00:01:42,150 --> 00:01:43,630
Daniel was gone.

33
00:01:43,650 --> 00:01:47,560
But the future he helped build didn't have to fall apart.
